select></label><label>Y <select id="yMetric"></select></label></div><svg class="chart" id="scatter" viewBox="0 0 620 300" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg><div class="sub">Bubble size = current capital signal. Click a point for the full specialization thesis.</div></div></section>
<section class="sectionGrid"><div class="panel"><h2>Capital-flow signal</h2><div class="sub">Normalized strategic signal. Raw dollars/units are shown separately and never simply added across categories.</div><div class="capitalBars" id="capitalBars" style="margin-top:14px"></div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Raw capital & activity observations</h2><div class="sub">Examples of the evidence beneath the scores. “Proxy” means the series is broader/narrower than the exact specialization node.</div><div class="rawList" id="rawList" style="margin-top:12px"></div></div></section>
<section class="panel tablePanel"><div class="tableHead"><div><h2 style="margin:0">Sortable opportunity universe</h2><div class="sub">Context-adjusted ranking with evidence-derived confidence and robustness.</div></div><button id="export" style="background:#0a1722;color:#fff;border:1px solid #2a4358;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 11px;cursor:pointer">Export ranked CSV</button></div><div class="tableScroll"><table><thead><tr><th data-sort="rank">#</th><th data-sort="name">Opportunity node</th><th data-sort="score">Selected</th><th data-sort="market">Market</th><th data-sort="career">Career</th><th data-sort="fit">Fit</th><th data-sort="top5">Top-5 P</th><th data-sort="capital">Capital</th><th data-sort="capitalQuality">Capital quality</th><th data-sort="momentum">Momentum</th><th data-sort="durability">Durability</th><th data-sort="scarcity">Scarcity</th><th data-sort="income">Income</th><th data-sort="aiResilience">AI resilience</th><th data-sort="valueCapture">Value capture</th><th data-sort="entrepreneurship">Entrepreneurship</th><th data-sort="defensibility">Defensibility</th><th data-sort="accessibility">Access</th><th data-sort="proofability">Proof</th><th data-sort="crowdingRisk">Crowding</th><th data-sort="hypeRisk">Hype</th><th data-sort="confidence">Confidence</th></tr></thead><tbody id="tbody"></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Evidence base</h2><div class="sub">Observed data, forecasts and model judgments remain separately labelled.</div><div class="srcList" id="sources" style="margin-top:12px"></div></section>
<section class="sectionGrid"><div class="panel"><h2>Live structured signals</h2><div class="sub">Raw API observations are stored separately from recommendation scores so you can inspect what the live feeds actually say before they influence the model.</div><div id="liveSignals" class="rawList" style="margin-top:10px"><div class="sub">Loading structured signals…</div></div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Signal ingestion status</h2><div id="signalStatus" class="sub">Connecting to signal store…</div><div class="stamp" style="margin-top:10px"><span class="chip" id="signalCountChip">Signal observations: —</span><span class="chip" id="signalRunChip">Signal refresh: —</span></div></div></section>
<section class="sectionGrid"><div class="panel"><h2>Live data status</h2><div id="liveStatus" class="sub">Loading Git-backed data…</div><div class="stamp" style="margin-top:10px"><span class="chip" id="lastRefreshChip">Refresh: —</span><span class="chip" id="reviewQueueChip">Review queue: —</span><span class="chip" id="discoveryChip">New discoveries: —</span><span class="chip" id="snapshotCountChip">Snapshots: —</span></div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Snapshot history</h2><div class="sub">Compare validated publications from static snapshot history.</div><div class="controlGrid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto;margin-top:10px"><label>From<select id="historyFrom"></select></label><label>To<select id="historyTo"></select></label><label>Compare<button id="historyCompare">Compare</button></label></div><div id="historySummary" class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">History appears after validated dataset snapshots are generated.</div></div></section>
<div class="footerNote">V5 zero-cost methodology: raw flows are never pooled into a single dollar total across incompatible categories. Strategic scores remain judgments anchored to evidence; context, uncertainty and sensitivity are made explicit. Use clusters and robustness rather than tiny score differences as the meaningful output.</div></div>
<div class="drawer" id="drawer"><div class="drawerPane"><button class="drawerClose" id="closeDrawer">Close</button><div id="drawerContent"></div></div></div>
<script src="./app-core.js"></script>
<script src="./bootstrap.js"></script>
</body></html>